# Gen 4-9 Pokémon on trainers, second pass (round 1 follow-up, feedback 1.40, D-240 - D-242,
# docs/hack_trainers.md "Gen 4-9 swaps"): four changed trainers from four stretches of the game send out
# their new Gen 4-9 lead. Needs rustboro_done.ss from tests/rustboro.play in the same output directory.
# The party is the Lv 6 hatchling, so the later battles are lost on purpose (FLAG_DRACONID_NO_WHITEOUT):
# this checks the data and the scripts, not balance. Each battle waits for the opponent's species in
# gBattleMons[1] (struct BattlePokemon is 0x8C bytes, species first; the ids are hex SPECIES_* values from
# include/constants/species.h), takes a frame series of the send-out (NAME_00 ... NAME_15), then mashes A to the end.
#   Tommy (Rustboro Gym, S1, gym trainers get their gym's type, D-241): Roggenrola (0x20C) for a Geodude
#   Helene (Route 115 north, S6, two from S5 on, D-240): Hawlucha (0x2BD) for her Machoke, Lucario behind it
#   Magma grunt 1 (Magma Hideout 1F, S7, grunts get one, D-242): Salazzle (0x2F6) for his Weezing
#   Felix (Victory Road B2F, S9): Barbaracle (0x2B1) for his Starmie, Golurk behind it
loadstate rustboro_done.ss
setflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_TRAINER_SEE
setflag FLAG_DRACONID_NO_WHITEOUT
setflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_ENCOUNTER
heal
# --- Tommy: stands at (3, 9) facing left; the player talks to him from (2, 9)
settrainer TRAINER_TOMMY 0
warp MAP_RUSTBORO_CITY_GYM 2 9
run 60
press RIGHT 2 16
press A 2 16
until @gMain+4 4 @@BattleMainCB2 3000 A 30
until @gBattleMons+8C 2 20C 600
run 40
shot g01_tommy_00
press A 2 8
run 40
shot g01_tommy_01
press A 2 8
run 40
shot g01_tommy_02
press A 2 8
run 40
shot g01_tommy_03
press A 2 8
run 40
shot g01_tommy_04
press A 2 8
run 40
shot g01_tommy_05
press A 2 8
run 40
shot g01_tommy_06
press A 2 8
run 40
shot g01_tommy_07
press A 2 8
run 40
shot g01_tommy_08
press A 2 8
run 40
shot g01_tommy_09
press A 2 8
run 40
shot g01_tommy_10
press A 2 8
run 40
shot g01_tommy_11
press A 2 8
run 40
shot g01_tommy_12
press A 2 8
run 40
shot g01_tommy_13
press A 2 8
run 40
shot g01_tommy_14
press A 2 8
run 40
shot g01_tommy_15
press A 2 8
mash A 30000
expect_opponent TRAINER_TOMMY
heal
